From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Mecid <mecid@mecomediagroup.de>
Date: Tue, 3 Nov 2026 03:49:49 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] imx8mp_debix_model_a: keep the environment on the boot device

U-Boot read and wrote the environment on the SD card, also when the
board booted from eMMC. Use the boot device instead.

Signed-off-by: Mecid <mecid@mecomediagroup.de>
---
 board/polyhex/imx8mp_debix_model_a/imx8mp_debix_model_a.c | 6 ++++++
 1 file changed, 6 insertions(+)

diff --git a/board/polyhex/imx8mp_debix_model_a/imx8mp_debix_model_a.c b/board/polyhex/imx8mp_debix_model_a/imx8mp_debix_model_a.c
index 2884b338..20e510e6 100644
--- a/board/polyhex/imx8mp_debix_model_a/imx8mp_debix_model_a.c
+++ b/board/polyhex/imx8mp_debix_model_a/imx8mp_debix_model_a.c
@@ -90,6 +90,12 @@ int board_phys_sdram_size(phys_size_t *size)
 	return 0;
 }
 
+/* Keep the environment on the boot device: mmc1 is SD, mmc2 is eMMC. */
+int board_mmc_get_env_dev(int devno)
+{
+	return devno;
+}
+
 int board_init(void)
 {
 	int ret = 0;
